        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86693, Industrial Chic Jasper Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe industrial chic Jasper Appliance Pull is available in all the top finish colors of the year. It is available in two sizes: 12 inch center to center length and 18 inch center to center length. This Emtek Jasper Refrigerator Handle comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to install it on a refrigerator door. It can also be used on other 3/4 inch thick appliance panels throughout your kitchen.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/jasper-cabinet-pull-emtek-86686\"><b>Emtek Jasper Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Jasper Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86693-specifications.pdf?v=1704262399\"><b>Emtek Jasper Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86693:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86694:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
